            <div xml:id="m-3ba69133-c6f0-47bb-b181-72388e5fdad0">
              <lg xml:id="m-abaa5f7b-9434-4741-b43c-86f1fa7862c1">
                <l xml:id="m-23e7e2e7-5f46-443f-9dd9-c6887da27c4b" facs="#m-9781fe9a-43b5-464b-9a0e-4462c757a53a" label="text-like">Sunday at None.</l><l xml:id="m-77185ecd-6ef3-4337-b223-9572c0160732" facs="#m-43cd89b0-715a-4ff7-8ace-3a48a557353c" label="ambiguous">245</l><l xml:id="m-4f51c5eb-48d1-43ab-8554-74b07beada49" facs="#m-55bb7ce2-0944-4899-9f61-902eb633d68e" label="text-like">SUNDAY AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-d9ad555d-96ef-4d90-acf3-5941fd16c80f" facs="#m-e2cd9378-6735-4cef-870c-e0e99191fde6" label="lyrics-like">Páter nóster. Ave Maria.</l><l xml:id="m-aa6f5f25-e5d9-43f7-9194-80d39c92afe6" facs="#m-64cd732e-d4df-4816-947a-a3057050e631" label="lyrics-like">V. Déus in adjutórium. p. 263.</l><l xml:id="m-6c2b1f6b-a81b-4d8e-aa9a-126ecbfc4750" facs="#m-5c701bd1-9fd1-4ee3-99ab-111899bac5ac" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-5954ceaf-8e71-45f4-9716-064502acef2f" facs="#m-ce5058f6-671c-44a6-8f17-23124867b34a" label="text-like">1. On Ordinary Sundays.</l><l xml:id="m-f49fa48d-447f-429f-bb30-3d042ee5fee3" facs="#m-49b82e70-6e82-4778-a0e4-96a0bac7e2de" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-ae880652-6c2b-41ff-b8b8-ac5072ef34c6" facs="#m-3d7b799a-b78e-4eb4-ace5-bb02fd8acc2a" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-ce4f7c36-9e34-4e93-ae9a-456db6927d09" facs="#m-3f511cef-b386-437d-9f53-34c24ada3500" label="lyrics-like">Erum Dé-us ténax vígor, Immótus in te pérma¬</l><l xml:id="m-57c29724-f466-4de6-adb8-7f56e3f599f0" facs="#m-3ab42738-ee9b-44e2-8921-2c7977f6448f" label="lyrics-like">nens, Lú-cis di-úrnae témpora Succéssibus de-términans:</l><l xml:id="m-5fd32199-2bb8-4bf3-a925-745d2f999142" facs="#m-c86d0910-e2b1-4dd6-8ca1-a852dad75a2b" label="text-like">2. On Solemn Feasts.</l><l xml:id="m-da47153e-799e-4377-ba46-4e4ea97b276b" facs="#m-f3d202a0-11ed-4f3e-b39f-93dccc5c4ab0" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-98addc60-bf87-476a-9e89-a1fc832fd4c2" facs="#m-78e8d8f5-3c8f-4c0c-92bd-6719f2e8afb7" label="lyrics-like">RErum Dé-us ténax vígor,</l><l xml:id="m-2a4475a6-2aec-4098-9c02-9062677fb402" facs="#m-8450e2f2-8abb-4291-8cea-9aa85e49444b" label="lyrics-like">Immótus in te pér¬</l><l xml:id="m-17b762de-e225-4512-8508-037aaeeeab7d" facs="#m-31186b86-6be9-486c-9a2e-a40f202c2690" label="lyrics-like">Succéssibus de-tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-aba000f8-aada-43a5-82d9-5ca5e613c2b7" facs="#m-782f457c-0b40-47eb-a827-6c0ef13061b5" label="lyrics-like">manens, Lú-cis di-úrnae témpo-ra</l><l xml:id="m-340f89bf-65fe-423a-be88-b1e5ba06cab3" facs="#m-62e66eb5-1413-49da-bc55-1198996679ff" label="ambiguous">mi-nans:</l><l xml:id="m-01f2b1b5-00ad-44ba-a4d6-c250b787768e" facs="#m-1557a23a-17fe-4801-842f-32d217a01be6" label="lyrics-like">Largíre lúmen véspere,</l><l xml:id="m-745a122f-30d4-4ada-ad7b-bb5638108398" facs="#m-f199e5e5-c87b-4e89-81d2-ea0332b6c758" label="lyrics-like">Praésta, Páter puíssime,</l><l xml:id="m-c5fb0bff-4a3f-4f57-a2ad-02d700f7d398" facs="#m-ef1b5518-861f-46bd-adfa-3331d7dea475" label="lyrics-like">Quo víta nusquam décidat,</l><l xml:id="m-c0fce4ed-640b-4527-9835-5fc469214550" facs="#m-248a5fdf-d5ba-4bae-aec3-5f9e42c2407e" label="lyrics-like">Patrique cómpar Unice,</l><l xml:id="m-abd589fd-9b33-4b15-8377-dc5a2c5f0a14" facs="#m-d5bb0de1-9ca4-477c-9620-a2d94ab42200" label="lyrics-like">Cum Spiritu Paráclito,</l><l xml:id="m-28a6cf80-a957-4a7d-a6f3-900356712c3b" facs="#m-3455f214-c0c0-47b8-a149-115ce6322ed6" label="lyrics-like">Sed praémium mórtis sácrae</l><l xml:id="m-e73b347f-e4d0-4376-ad2d-0c33c0654ae4" facs="#m-94c46549-8de1-4b0b-99fd-3cbffa019286" label="lyrics-like">Régnans per ómne saéculum.</l><l xml:id="m-53564a4d-c360-4608-a2fc-2f7e627fe337" facs="#m-b9e0e6a3-14d5-43b3-b03e-6141d92afec1" label="lyrics-like">Perénnis instet glória.</l><l xml:id="m-2991077b-673a-490a-8b2a-8dfd14944ae7" facs="#m-67c5a5a4-19fc-4f42-a252-1a828a3ea1da" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-34111855-e495-482b-bcce-f2835c995987" facs="#m-3a38fa8e-df33-4c05-b614-7718e1c3fa56" label="text-like">During the Year.</l><l xml:id="m-88ef9527-f750-4ea3-b48b-d9a0dd4879e0" facs="#m-c76fe139-e4f1-4a20-95e8-e47b25e06200" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-2662af35-5b62-4dee-92de-397252a01ba6" facs="#m-6aa0e3fc-f9e6-4db5-bea9-314989f453fb" label="lyrics-like">5. à</l><l xml:id="m-fe0e86eb-643a-43c9-89ac-0ca87350fdd9" facs="#m-8d3e7879-704b-437c-9033-ac7b626dae78" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-1ed42071-2833-4ab5-a961-2f50dfb81e4c" facs="#m-8267f6e7-2674-4419-a611-e7b11843e244" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-59cb1e1d-66d0-49d4-aea2-2d9734ee4a0a" facs="#m-04713af9-b18f-4f0e-b42f-f7e0f81e8bcf" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
